    <Folder>
      <name>2026瑞士</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>The Freddie Mercury Hotel</name>
        <description>7/30-8/1</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FF5252</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            6.9117244,46.4337695,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Château de Chillon 西庸堡</name>
        <description>7/30</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            6.9274924,46.4142131,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Montreux 蒙特魯</name>
        <description>7/30-8/1</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            6.9106799,46.4312213,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Gruyères 格呂耶爾</name>
        <description>7/31</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1535-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.0624775,46.5777555,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Broc-Fabrique</name>
        <description>7/31</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.1071137,46.6072268,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Maison Cailler  巧克力工廠</name>
        <description>7/31</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.1087393,46.6068782,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>La Maison du Gruyère 芝士專賣店</name>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1-nodesc</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.0731036,46.5822397,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Hotel Bahnhof Zermatt</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/1-8/4<br>直奔空氣清新的無車環保山城——策馬特！我們將搭乘經典的「高納葛拉特 (Gornergrat) 景觀火車」上山，並帶著孩子輕鬆步行至利菲爾湖 (Riffelsee)，捕捉馬特洪峰最經典的完美倒影<br>。 隔天，搭乘歐洲最高纜車直達「冰川天堂 (Glacier Paradise)」，帶您進入神祕冰宮探險；午後乘坐地下纜車前往 Sunnegga，漫步於最精華的五湖步道 (Stellisee)，將阿爾卑斯山的絕景盡收眼底<br>https://www.matterhornparadise.ch/en/experience/hiking/hiking-map]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-E65100</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7488,46.024405,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Lavaux-Oron District</name>
        <description>8/1</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            6.7531955,46.5100372,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Visp 菲斯普</name>
        <description>8/1 搭乘火車經 Visp 轉車，直奔無車山城策馬特。</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.8821204,46.2947277,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Gornergrat 戈爾內格拉特</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/2<br>搭乘齒軌火車上山，回程在 Rotenboden 站下車，帶孩子輕鬆走到利菲爾湖 (Riffelsee) 拍經典倒影。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7846801,45.9834759,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Rotenboden</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/2<br>搭乘齒軌火車上山，回程在 Rotenboden 站下車，帶孩子輕鬆走到利菲爾湖 (Riffelsee) 拍經典倒影。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.765374,45.984466,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Riffelsee</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/2<br>搭乘齒軌火車上山，回程在 Rotenboden 站下車，帶孩子輕鬆走到利菲爾湖 (Riffelsee) 拍經典倒影。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7620615,45.983269,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Matterhorn Glacier Paradise</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/3 <br>冰川天堂 (Glacier Paradise) 與 五湖健行]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7299493,45.9386091,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Sunnegga</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/3<br>下午：搭乘地下纜車至 Sunnegga，走一段最精華的五湖步道（至 Stellisee）。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7712715,46.0162203,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Stellisee</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/3<br>下午：搭乘地下纜車至 Sunnegga，走一段最精華的五湖步道（至 Stellisee）。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.8006047,46.0134977,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Interlaken 因特拉肯</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/4-8/7<br>前進伯恩高地！我們將搭乘最新科技的「艾格快線 (Eiger Express)」纜車，以最快速度直達歐洲之巔——少女峰 (Jungfraujoch)，在雪地與冰宮中盡情玩耍<br>。 接著前往格林德瓦的 First 山區，挑戰懸崖步道，體力許可還能走到絕美的 Bachalpsee 高山湖泊！下山時，全家一起體驗刺激好玩的「山景滑板車 (Trottibike)」。若時間充裕，還能持 Swiss Travel Pass (STP) 免費搭乘遊船，巡遊寶石般的圖恩湖或布里恩茲湖]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.8632049,46.6863481,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Interlaken Youth Hostel 尤根德黑爾貝格因特拉肯</name>
        <description>8/4-8/7</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.8678887,46.690291,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Thunersee 圖恩湖</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/4 <br>下午：若時間充裕，可持 STP 免費搭乘遊船巡遊「圖恩湖 (Thunersee)」或「布里恩茲湖 (Brienzersee)」。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.7212158,46.6958354,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Brienzersee 布里恩茨湖</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/4 <br>下午：若時間充裕，可持 STP 免費搭乘遊船巡遊「圖恩湖 (Thunersee)」或「布里恩茲湖 (Brienzersee)」。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.9674729,46.7267426,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Jungfraujoch 少女峰站</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/5<br>搭乘艾格快線 (Eiger Express) 直達歐洲之巔，帶孩子體驗冰宮與雪地活動。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.9806434,46.5482766,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Grindelwald 格林德瓦</name>
        <description>8/6</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.0413962,46.624164,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Männlichen 曼利申</name>
        <description>8/6</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.9380647,46.6181443,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Start of the Panorama Hiking Trail "Männlichen zur Kleinen Scheidegg"]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/6 <br>從曼利申纜車站走到小夏戴克車站，路程好走平緩下坡。沿路都可看見少女峰、艾格峰、僧侶峰，非常棒的輕鬆健行路線。]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            7.9433432,46.6108938,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Bachalpsee</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/6 <br>健行 高山湖泊]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.023333,46.669444,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Hotel Central Luzern</name>
        <description>8/7-8/9</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-E65100</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.3077489,47.0492023,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Luzern 陸森市</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/7-8/9<br>搭乘精華的「琉森-因特拉肯快線」，坐在列車右側，完美捕捉布里恩茲湖與沿途瀑布的風光。抵達琉森後，漫步於古色古香的卡貝爾橋與垂死獅子像前。 隔天展開「皮拉圖斯山 (Pilatus) 金色環遊」！這是一場海陸空大滿貫：STP 免費涵蓋遊船與巴士，並以半價體驗「世界最陡齒軌火車」與景觀纜車。傍晚還能到石丹峰欣賞夕陽，幸運的話還能遇見可愛土撥鼠]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.3093072,47.0501682,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Pilatus 皮拉圖斯峰</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/8 <br>帶著孩子體驗遊船、世界最陡齒軌火車與景觀纜車的豐富交通組合。<br>石丹峰（五六）有夜間車，可欣賞夕陽，土撥鼠]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.2548011,46.9794705,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Schaffhausen沙夫豪森</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/9-8/11<br>最後一站來到沙夫豪森 (Schaffhausen)，欣賞古城區獨特的濕壁畫與鐘錶工藝，並透過南岸徒步與北岸遊船，超近距離感受歐洲最大瀑布——「萊茵瀑布 (Rhine Falls)」的水花與震撼，為這趟瑞士大環遊畫下完美句點]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.6380488,47.6958897,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Vienna House zur Bleiche Schaffhausen</name>
        <description>8/9-8/11</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-E65100</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.632344,47.699246,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Zürich 蘇黎世</name>
        <description><![CDATA[8/9<br>旅程尾聲，我們將在蘇黎世舊城區穿梭，體驗多段式齒軌纜車 (UBS Polybahn)，感受蘇黎世聯邦理工學院的學術氣息，俯瞰林登霍夫山的市區美景。 ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            8.541694,47.3768866,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
